# Line endings.
#
# This repo has core.autocrlf=true, so most files are stored LF in the blob
# and checked out CRLF in the working tree. Five files are different: they
# are stored WITH CRLF in the blob itself. Verified 2026-09-03 by comparing
# every tracked blob against its working copy.
#
# Marking those five -text stops git converting them in either direction.
# That is a no-op for what is already committed, and it prevents a future
# core.autocrlf / core.eol change from renormalising them -- which would
# rewrite app.py's 7,639 lines and index.html's in a single "whitespace"
# commit and bury whatever real change rode along with it.
#
# This does NOT stop an editor rewriting them in text mode. That is what
# .editorconfig is for; the two files are a pair, not alternatives.
app.py                           -text
templates/index.html             -text
chrome-extension/popup.html      -text
chrome-extension/popup.js        -text
chrome-extension/tests/README.md -text

# Binary assets — never diff or convert these.
*.png   binary
*.ico   binary
*.docx  binary
*.db    binary
*.zip   binary
